{{template "header" .}}<p>{{.IssuedDate}}</p>
<p>To Whom It May Concern:</p>
<p>This is to certify that <strong>{{.MenteeName}}</strong> successfully completed the <strong>{{.ProgramName}}</strong> mentorship program at The Linux Foundation{{with .TermPeriod}} from {{.}}{{end}}. The Linux Foundation administers the Mentorship program, which gives participants an opportunity to develop their skills and contribute to open source projects; however, {{.MenteeName}} was not an employee of The Linux Foundation.</p>
